  "description": "A SDK to comunicate between your app and Appwrite server.\nThis SDK does support Server & Client opterations.\n\nAppwrite Version - 1.8.x\n\nAccount - Supported\nUsers - Unsupported\nTeams - Supported\nDatabase - \n      Read / Write - Supported\n      POCO / DAO  - Supported\n      Structure - WIP\n      Auto structure - Unsupported\n      Relationships - Supported\n      TableDB - Unsuported\nRealtime - Supported\nStorage - Supported\nFunctions - \n      Client - Supported\n      Server - Semi-Support\n      Runtime - Exturnal\nMessaging - Unsupported\nSites - Unsupported",
